> expect streets 2
  ok: 2 streets
> streets
  s0  runs east (lots on its north side), cells 10..252
  s1  runs north (lots on its west side), cells 10..252, from crossroads #3
    crossroads #3: s0:62 = s1:131 (cell A62)
> ride #last
  rider: s0:62 facing +
> turn up
  rider: s1:131 facing +
> expect rider s1
